## A ward for the house
Since the milk turned sour in the pail, there has been talk in your household of a horseshoe over the door. Ezekiel Crane is here with you and sells horseshoes. Buy it now — call pay_with_item with seller "Ezekiel Crane", item "horseshoe", a qty up to 1, a payment: coins (amount), goods you carry (pay_items), or both, with consume_now false, and your handoff line in say. Do not speak first: speaking ends your turn, and the offer would never be made. They will accept or counter your offer.

Weigh what's in front of you — obligations and pressing needs come before idle matters. Choose one action, then call done() when nothing pressing remains.
